esolve through `specs/`.\n- **Do NOT:** write outside `.../research/lineages/ds-b`.\n\n---\n\n## 13. RESEARCH BOUNDARIES\n- Max iterations: 5\n- Convergence threshold: 0.05 (telemetry-only; stop policy = max-iterations)\n- Per-iteration budget: 12 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Progressive synthesis: true (default)\n- research/research.md ownership: workflow-owned canonical synthesis output\n- Lifecycle branches: `new` (fan-out lineage ds-b)\n- Canonical pause sentinel: `research/.deep-research-pause`\n- Started: 2026-08-13T09:10:00Z","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":171,"totalLines":171,"truncated":false}},"title":"specs/system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation/057-phase-consolidation-research/research/lineages/ds-b/deep-research-strategy.md","time":{"start":1786606480396,"end":1786606480402}},"id":"prt_ffa0b6a3b001KnbM9YApcgWRxg","sessionID":"ses_005f4b821ffejLYlBuxZY5ty3R","messageID":"msg_ffa0b4b9d001gNoZN6Njn6gEn0"}}
